---
// Approved Living Systems composition; native Astro, no client framework.

---
<span id="flow-overview-heading" class="ls-anchor-alias" aria-hidden="true"></span>

<section class="ls-visual-episode ls-container" id="how-it-works">
<div class="ls-episode-copy">
<p class="ls-eyebrow">YOUR WORK HAS TWO RHYTHMS</p>
<h2>WITH YOU.<br/>WHILE YOU REST.<br/>
<span class="ls-stroke">ALWAYS WITHIN SCOPE.</span>
</h2>
<div class="ls-episode-dek">
<p>During the day, inspect each Agency proposal before it changes your document. At night, a standing job refreshes the parts you declared.</p>
<p>Return to marked changes. Keep what helps, or restore a part.</p>
</div>
</div>
<figure aria-label="Two rhythms. Your boundaries." class="ls-scene ls-permission-scene" data-frame="0" data-scene="true" data-scene-count="4">
<div class="ls-scene-chrome">
<span>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
</span>
<b>Two rhythms. Your boundaries.</b>
<span>FLOW / ILLUSTRATION</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-scene-body">
<div class="ls-permission-rail">
<div class="ls-rail-label">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-sun" fill="none" height="21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="21" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4">
</circle>
<path d="M12 2v2">
</path>
<path d="M12 20v2">
</path>
<path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="M2 12h2">
</path>
<path d="M20 12h2">
</path>
<path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41">
</path>
</svg>
<b>WITH YOU</b>
<small>Daytime Agency</small>
</div>
<div class="ls-rail-path">
<div data-scene-step="0">
<span>01</span>
<strong>Select a passage</strong>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div data-scene-step="1">
<span>02</span>
<strong>Inspect the exact diff</strong>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div data-scene-step="2">
<span>03</span>
<strong>Approve or decline</strong>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div data-scene-step="3">
<span>04</span>
<strong>Save + receipt</strong>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-permission-rail">
<div class="ls-rail-label">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-moon" fill="none" height="21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="21" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401">
</path>
</svg>
<b>WHILE YOU REST</b>
<small>Standing Night Shift job</small>
</div>
<div class="ls-rail-path">
<div data-scene-step="0">
<span>01</span>
<strong>Set sources + limits</strong>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div data-scene-step="1">
<span>02</span>
<strong>Refresh declared parts</strong>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div data-scene-step="2">
<span>03</span>
<strong>Morning Briefing</strong>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</div>
<div data-scene-step="3">
<span>04</span>
<strong>Keep or revert a part</strong>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ls-scene-note">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z">
</path>
<path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4">
</path>
</svg> A daytime proposal waits. A standing job acts within permission you already gave.</p>
</div>
<figcaption class="ls-scene-controls">
<span class="ls-scene-status">
<span data-scene-caption="0">01 / Choose the scope</span>
<span data-scene-caption="1" hidden="">02 / Inspect the work</span>
<span data-scene-caption="2" hidden="">03 / Make the decision</span>
<span data-scene-caption="3" hidden="">04 / Keep a trace</span>
</span>
<span>
<button aria-label="Next step: Two rhythms. Your boundaries." data-scene-next="true" type="button">Next <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-label="Replay: Two rhythms. Your boundaries." data-scene-replay="true" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8">
</path>
<path d="M3 3v5h5">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
